    <p class="addr">331 Swallowtail Court · Brisbane, CA 94005</p>
  </div>
  <div class="r">
    <p class="price"><small>Sold for</small>$700,000</p>
    <ul class="facts"><li>27 days on market</li><li>Sold November 2026</li></ul>
