lt="Kitchen with stainless steel appliances and a gas cooktop"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="8" aria-label="Open photo: Kitchen sink and counter looking into the living room"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g09.jpg" alt="Kitchen sink and counter looking into the living room"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="9" aria-label="Open photo: Kitchen with refrigerator, wall oven and window"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g10.jpg" alt="Kitchen with refrigerator, wall oven and window"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="10" aria-label="Open photo: Mountain view from the balcony railing"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g11.jpg" alt="Mountain view from the balcony railing"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="11" aria-label="Open photo: Balcony seen through the bedroom sliding door"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g12.jpg" alt="Balcony seen through the bedroom sliding door"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="12" aria-label="Open photo: Bedroom with a sliding door to the balcony"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g13.jpg" alt="Bedroom with a sliding door to the balcony"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="13" aria-label="Open photo: Bedroom with the hallway beyond"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g14.jpg" alt="Bedroom with the hallway beyond"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="14" aria-label="Open photo: Second bedroom with tall windows"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g15.jpg" alt="Second bedroom with tall windows"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="15" aria-label="Open photo: Second bedroom"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g16.jpg" alt="Second bedroom"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="16" aria-label="Open photo: Bath with a double vanity"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g17.jpg" alt="Bath with a double vanity"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="17" aria-label="Open photo: Second bath"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g18.jpg" alt="Second bath"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="18" aria-label="Open photo: Laundry closet with washer and dryer"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g19.jpg" alt="Laundry closet with washer and dryer"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="19" aria-label="Open photo: View from a bedroom window"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g20.jpg" alt="View from a bedroom window"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="20" aria-label="Open photo: Walkways and landscaping at Altamar at the Ridge"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g21.jpg" alt="Walkways and landscaping at Altamar at the Ridge"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="21" aria-label="Open photo: Walkway to the front entrances"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g22.jpg" alt="Walkway to the front entrances"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="22" aria-label="Open photo: Parking and grounds"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g23.jpg" alt="Parking and grounds"></button><button type="button" class="g" data-i="23" aria-label="Open photo: Front door of 331 Swallowtail Court"><img class="ph-land" loading="lazy" src="/listings/331-swallowtail-ct/g24.jpg" alt="Front door of 331 Swallowtail Court"></button></div>
</div></section>

